1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,123
Borrow the beam.

2
00:00:01,437 --> 00:00:02,369
Back in three years.

3
00:00:02,637 --> 00:00:04,045
If the ancestors are angry,

4
00:00:04,112 --> 00:00:06,278
blame this old man.

5
00:00:06,621 --> 00:00:07,915
Rope's tied.

6
00:00:08,710 --> 00:00:09,199
Stand back,

7
00:00:09,385 --> 00:00:10,504
beam's coming down.

8
00:00:15,886 --> 00:00:18,431
Brother Xu, can you hold it?

9
00:00:19,429 --> 00:00:20,907
Drought mission:

10
00:00:21,029 --> 00:00:22,790
seven days left.

11
00:00:22,865 --> 00:00:24,090
Seven days?

12
00:00:24,154 --> 00:00:25,472
A wheel this big,

13
00:00:25,829 --> 00:00:27,833
no way in seven days.

14
00:00:27,897 --> 00:00:29,088
Yes, there is.

15
00:00:29,151 --> 00:00:30,732
You lead the men, I'll draw.

16
00:00:30,792 --> 00:00:31,918
If it fails,

17
00:00:32,117 --> 00:00:33,494
the beam's on you.

18
00:00:33,673 --> 00:00:34,706
Every able man in the village,

19
00:00:35,072 --> 00:00:36,362
three shifts!

20
00:00:36,548 --> 00:00:38,596
One works, two sleep,

21
00:00:38,673 --> 00:00:40,952
keep rotating, no stopping.

22
00:00:41,028 --> 00:00:42,015
The sugar shop's sugar

23
00:00:42,083 --> 00:00:43,619
bought thirty pounds of nails.

24
00:00:43,687 --> 00:00:44,576
Good nails.

25
00:00:44,887 --> 00:00:46,330
Tear down the hall,

26
00:00:46,805 --> 00:00:48,752
and heaven strikes you down!

27
00:00:48,930 --> 00:00:51,006
Casting off your own ancestors,

28
00:00:51,075 --> 00:00:54,749
Liuxi's bloodline ends right here.

29
00:00:55,159 --> 00:00:56,325
Heaven's wrath…

30
00:00:56,388 --> 00:00:58,451
So… do we still tear it down?

31
00:00:58,524 --> 00:01:00,351
The ancestors are thirsty too!

32
00:01:00,427 --> 00:01:01,173
When the water comes,

33
00:01:01,427 --> 00:01:03,338
ancestors drink first!

34
00:01:03,411 --> 00:01:07,303
Haha, ancestors drink first!

35
00:01:08,879 --> 00:01:09,900
Go on, laugh.

36
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:14,161
When day ten comes, we'll see who's crying.

37
00:01:16,208 --> 00:01:16,915
Second shift,

38
00:01:16,984 --> 00:01:17,719
switch!

39
00:01:17,784 --> 00:01:19,771
Angle the blades three degrees,

40
00:01:20,082 --> 00:01:20,939
build it like this.

41
00:01:21,007 --> 00:01:21,853
One piece each,

42
00:01:22,001 --> 00:01:23,424
eat up, get strong!

43
00:01:23,502 --> 00:01:24,596
Last piece.

44
00:01:27,705 --> 00:01:28,364
Frame's up.

45
00:01:28,697 --> 00:01:30,870
Whether it turns, we'll see at noon.

46
00:01:31,148 --> 00:01:32,676
Drought mission:

47
00:01:32,771 --> 00:01:34,569
expires today.

48
00:01:34,826 --> 00:01:36,064
Open the gate.

49
00:01:36,452 --> 00:01:37,138
Erniu, pull!

50
00:01:42,052 --> 00:01:42,663
Turn… come on…

51
00:01:43,781 --> 00:01:45,002
It stopped…

52
00:01:47,294 --> 00:01:49,116
Hahahaha!

53
00:01:49,440 --> 00:01:51,984
Seven days on that beam, for half a turn!

54
00:01:52,059 --> 00:01:55,119
Even heaven won't help you!
